WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:14.230
baseball players stood in the Metro City Stadium parking lot.

2
00:00:15.351 --> 00:00:17.372
"Big game tomorrow, Dale," one player said.

3
00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.374
"It'll be our first game without Hitz."

4
00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.976
"Good," Dale said.

5
00:00:21.996 --> 00:00:23.798
"He's a bad sport.

6
00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:26.920
He kept inventing equipment to help him cheat."

7
00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:28.662
Manny nodded.

8
00:00:28.682 --> 00:00:31.424
"I remember when he had that weird baseball.

9
00:00:32.268 --> 00:00:33.429
He could make it explode."

10
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:35.770
Dale shook his head.

11
00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.852
"I'm glad Coach Biggs kicked him off the team.

12
00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:40.973
See you tomorrow, Manny!"

13
00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:44.335
Just then a dark shadow covered the parking lot.

14
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:45.916
The players looked up.

15
00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:47.697
Dale gulped.

16
00:00:47.717 --> 00:00:49.899
"What is that?"

17
00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:52.780
"Another run!"

18
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:53.601
Terrell said.

19
00:00:53.621 --> 00:00:55.262
"This is awful."

20
00:00:56.703 --> 00:00:58.684
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Stadium.

21
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.541
The Metro City Miners were playing the Lumbertown Loggers.

22
00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:08.164
The Miners' pitcher threw the baseball.

23
00:01:08.224 --> 00:01:09.104
The batter swung.

24
00:01:09.564 --> 00:01:12.365
Crack! The ball landed in the stands.

25
00:01:16.687 --> 00:01:18.048
run for the Loggers!"

26
00:01:18.388 --> 00:01:19.168
the announcer said.

27
00:01:20.069 --> 00:01:20.849
Roxy groaned.

28
00:01:21.689 --> 00:01:24.631
"The Miners' pitcher is terrible.

29
00:01:25.371 --> 00:01:27.252
The Loggers have three runs already."

30
00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:31.263
"I can't believe Dale Rivers isn't here," Jack said.

31
00:01:31.283 --> 00:01:32.964
"He's our star pitcher!"

32
00:01:33.785 --> 00:01:34.705
The pitcher threw again.

33
00:01:36.887 --> 00:01:38.809
The batter swung and then ran to first base.

34
00:01:42.031 --> 00:01:43.512
Two more batters got onto bases.

35
00:01:50.198 --> 00:01:51.779
loaded!" the announcer said.

36
00:01:54.882 --> 00:01:57.304
The next batter sent the ball far into the stands.

37
00:02:00.684 --> 00:02:03.587
"That's a grand slam for the Loggers!"

38
00:02:04.127 --> 00:02:04.908
the announcer said.

39
00:02:04.928 --> 00:02:08.371
"No!" Mara cried.

40
00:02:08.391 --> 00:02:11.894
"The Loggers are winning, seven to nothing!"

41
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:14.116
Jack sighed.

42
00:02:14.136 --> 00:02:16.858
"We'll never catch up.

43
00:02:17.538 --> 00:02:18.780
Manny Gomez isn't here.

44
00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.422
He's the Miners' best home run hitter."

45
00:02:22.483 --> 00:02:24.765
Another Loggers player was soon on second base.

46
00:02:24.785 --> 00:02:28.488
"I wish Rocket Girl could help," Jack said.

47
00:02:29.652 --> 00:02:32.933
"If she played for the Miners, she'd get a million home runs!"

48
00:02:36.575 --> 00:02:39.356
Terrell covered his face and moaned.

49
00:02:39.376 --> 00:02:41.917
"This is a really bad game."

50
00:02:43.058 --> 00:02:44.378
Mara's stomach grumbled.

51
00:02:44.398 --> 00:02:46.219
"I'm hungry."

52
00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.620
She looked over her shoulder.

53
00:02:49.761 --> 00:02:51.381
A snack bar was at the top of the steps.

54
00:02:51.401 --> 00:02:54.723
"But I don't want to miss any of the game."

55
00:02:56.244 --> 00:02:57.004
Terrell looked up.

56
00:02:57.792 --> 00:02:59.513
"You can't get up while the Miners are pitching!

57
00:02:59.813 --> 00:03:00.614
It's bad luck!"

58
00:03:01.635 --> 00:03:02.415
"I know!"

59
00:03:02.755 --> 00:03:03.356
Mara said.

60
00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.217
Roxy grinned.

61
00:03:05.237 --> 00:03:08.779
"It's too bad Rocket Girl can't get a snack for you."

62
00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.342
"Ha-ha." Mara pretended to laugh.

63
00:03:13.923 --> 00:03:14.924
Roxy's watch beeped.

64
00:03:18.206 --> 00:03:19.847
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered.

65
00:03:19.867 --> 00:03:21.708
"Is everything okay?"

66
00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:23.970
The mayor looked worried.

67
00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:27.232
"Rocket Girl, I need you to go to Police Headquarters.

68
00:03:28.384 --> 00:03:30.025
Two Miners players disappeared.

69
00:03:30.846 --> 00:03:33.748
No one can find them."

70
00:03:33.888 --> 00:03:35.549
"Oh no," Roxy whispered.

71
00:03:35.569 --> 00:03:38.631
"You mean Dale Rivers and Manny Gomez, right?"

72
00:03:39.732 --> 00:03:40.632
Mayor Bloom nodded.

73
00:03:40.652 --> 00:03:43.775
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

74
00:03:43.795 --> 00:03:45.456
"I'll find them."
